{"availability":"available","full":"RyanZeeee/Tesla-UI-prototype","name":"Tesla-UI-prototype","description":"Tesla‑UI‑prototype is a React‑ & Three.js‑powered Tesla‑style car‑UI prototype. It offers interactive 3D car model, HVAC & seat controls, simulated navigation, music player and vehicle settings. Pure client‑side demo with partial local config storage. Tesla‑UI‑prototype 是使用 React、Three.js 实现的特斯拉风格车机原型，提供 3D 车模交互、空调座椅控制、模拟导航、音乐播放器及车控设置，纯前端项目，部分本地存储。","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":7,"forks":2,"created":"2026-09-14T09:13:48Z","updated":"2026-09-19T11:07:47Z","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["automotive-ui","car-ui","prototype","react","tesla","tesla-ui","three-js","typescript","ui-prototype","vite"],"demo":"https://ryanzeeee.github.io/Tesla-UI-prototype/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T01:25:58.853Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T01:25:58.853Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T01:25:58.853Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T01:25:58.853Z","stars":7,"forks":2}],"technologies":["React","Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A Tesla-inspired in-car touchscreen prototype for exploring vehicle interfaces, interaction motion, and 3D presentation in the browser.","The project includes a real-time Model 3 viewer, a 3D climate interface, front-seat adjustment, a simulated navigation map, vehicle settings, and a music player. The interface uses a 1920 × 1200 design canvas that scales proportionally with the browser window.","This is an independent design prototype, not an official Tesla product. Vehicle controls, routes, tire readings, and playback are demonstrations: it does not connect to a real car, a live mapping service, or a music-streaming service."],"features":["Compact overhead view and an expanded, low-angle front three-quarter view.","Drag or use arrow keys to rotate only while expanded. After five seconds without rotation input, the camera smoothly returns to its default view.","Double-click, or press Home / Escape with the viewer focused, to reset the camera. Mouse-wheel zoom is intentionally disabled.","Animated frunk, trunk, and charge-port opening and closing, with leader lines and Open / Close controls pointing at the matching part.","While compact, the frunk and trunk controls appear on the right of the model and the charge-port control on the left."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RyanZeeee/Tesla-UI-prototype/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"433271ac40f7cbe64cd2abcaaadef5586b2e57fad5673922cebc90dfec9c7d6f","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T01:25:58.982Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T01:25:58.982Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A Tesla-inspired in-car touchscreen prototype for exploring vehicle interfaces, interaction motion, and 3D presentation in the browser.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RyanZeeee/Tesla-UI-prototype/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"No backend, API key, or account is required to run the prototype.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RyanZeeee/Tesla-UI-prototype/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"No backend, API key, or account is required to run the prototype.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RyanZeeee/Tesla-UI-prototype/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"433271ac40f7cbe64cd2abcaaadef5586b2e57fad5673922cebc90dfec9c7d6f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RyanZeeee/Tesla-UI-prototype/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T01:25:58.982Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-19T11:07:47Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RyanZeeee/Tesla-UI-prototype/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T01:25:58.983Z","hash":"433271ac40f7cbe64cd2abcaaadef5586b2e57fad5673922cebc90dfec9c7d6f","originalBytes":9376,"storedBytes":9376,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["vehicle","run","model","npm","browser","build","map","seat","docs","files","settings","controls","